  {
    "RowOffset": 777274,
    "RowId": 9618,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 1,000.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Absorbs 100% of damage dealt as HP and restores 1,000 MP\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Aethertrail Attunement</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Aetherflow Gauge Cost:</span> 1"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 777582,
    "RowId": 9619,
    "Description": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 777594,
    "RowId": 9620,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 1,000 to all nearby enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Restores own HP and the HP of nearby party members\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Cure Potency:</span> 2,000"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 777822,
    "RowId": 9621,
    "Description": "Creates a barrier around target that absorbs damage equivalent to a heal of 2,500 potency.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Adds a <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Lily</span> to your <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Healing Gauge</span> if the barrier is completely absorbed"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 778130,
    "RowId": 9622,
    "Description": "Increases target's damage taken by 10%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 6s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 778222,
    "RowId": 9623,
    "Description": "Reduces the potency of target's attacks by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 5s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 778322,
    "RowId": 9624,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 750.\nCannot use while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Army's Paeon</span> or the <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Wanderer's Minuet</span>.\n\n※Action changes to <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Pitch Perfect</span> while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Wanderer's Minuet</span>.\n※Action changes to <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Barrage</span> while under the effect of the <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Army's Paeon</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 778762,
    "RowId": 9625,
    "Description": "Doubles the number of strikes for a single-target weaponskill. Additional effects added only once.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 5s\nCan only be executed while under the effect of both <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Army's Paeon</span> and <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Repertoire</span>.\n\n※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 779098,
    "RowId": 9626,
    "Description": "Silences target.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 2s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 779166,
    "RowId": 9627,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 750.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Gauss Barrel Effect:</span> Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> by 25\nCan only be used when <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> is below 50.\n\n※Action changes to <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Cooldown</span> while a <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Gauss Barrel</span> is attached and the <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> is 50 or higher."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 779570,
    "RowId": 9628,
    "Description": "Replenishes your ammunition by 1 (up to a maximum of 3). Ammunition is used when executing weaponskills, increasing potency by 250, reducing recast time to 1.5s, and reducing <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> increase."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 779802,
    "RowId": 9629,
    "Description": "Returns the currently drawn arcanum back to your deck."
  },
