  {
    "RowOffset": 779954,
    "RowId": 9637,
    "Description": "Restores 25% of maximum HP and MP.\nCan only be executed while under the effect of <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Astral Fire</span> or <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Umbral Ice</span>. Removes <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Astral Fire</span> or <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Umbral Ice</span> upon execution."
  },
  {
